<!--
    EtherIconGeometries.xaml = Ether Design System - Icon Geometry Primitives

    Converted from the DDS2 SVG source (Assets/Icons/dds2/*.svg). Each icon is a
    Style (TargetType=PathIcon) whose Data Setter carries the XAML Path Mini-
    Language string, NOT a bare <Geometry x:Key=...> resource — declaring Geometry
    directly in a ResourceDictionary and resolving it via StaticResource/x:Bind
    throws a XamlParseException on this Windows App SDK version (verified with an
    isolated repro). Wrapping the same string in a Style Setter sidesteps it, since
    Setter value coercion goes through the DependencyProperty's own string-to-
    Geometry conversion instead of resource-object resolution.

    USAGE:
      <PathIcon Style="{StaticResource IconAddSqr}" Foreground="{ThemeResource IconPrimary}"
                Width="{StaticResource IconSizeMd}" Height="{StaticResource IconSizeMd}"/>

    Width/Height/Foreground are NOT part of the Style, so set them per usage —
    only Data is baked in. The original SVGs remain the source of truth in
    Assets/Icons/dds2/ — regenerate this file from them, don't hand-edit entries.
-->
